  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIn [dialog.show()](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#dom-dialog-show) step 7 adds this to the `open dialogs list`.\n\nIn [dialog.showModal()](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#dom-dialog-showmodal) step 13 first asserts that `open dialogs list` doesn't already contain this, before step 14 adds this to that list.\n\nI would have expected these to both have the same expectations of what is valid state or not, so I just wanted to clarify if there was a reason for this that I'm missing?",
